cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GeoDemand-FF, please cite this software."
title: "GeoDemand-FF"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Ilia"
    given-names: "Amin"
license: MIT
abstract: "GeoDemand-FF is a reproducible geospatial event-study pipeline for constructing candidate U.S. flood episodes from reported flood footprints and evaluating state-level search-interest responses before and after those episodes."
